cylinder   metal   at 300 54 -2 size 28 2 28 id light-gallery
cylinder   window  at 300 56 -2 size 14 10 14 id light-lamp
cone-10    slate   at 300 66 -2 size 20 12 20 id light-roof
box        metal   at 300 78 -2 size 2 4 2 id light-vane
